# L §5.16 Decisions and projections: a projection a decision reaches "reads a random amount dated after the
# decision's day as a question about the distribution as known on that day ... a random clause, on the projection
# read or on the ask line: random at mean evaluates each random amount the projection reaches after day t at its
# distribution's mean". save[2026-01] on 2026-01-05 reads bal(konto, end_of(m)) from its day: konto holds 10 000.00
# PLN, buy[2026-01] on the 15th pays spend[2026-01] at the mean of normal(1 000 PLN, 100 PLN), 1 000 PLN (table), so
# the projection gives 9 000.00 PLN (the decision itself left out, L §5.14.1) and save moves 9 000 - 8 000 = 1 000.00
# PLN. The ask line itself reads no random value, so it needs no query (konto's balance, which is random, it never
# reads).
=== m.tally
model r
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source own "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind spends: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input spend_mu: money PLN
input spend_sd: money PLN
input spend_dom: int
input dom: int
input floor: money PLN
def spend[m in months]: dist PLN = normal(spend_mu, spend_sd) to 1e-9 at end_of(m)

move buy[m in months]: spends
  on day_of(m, spend_dom)
  at end_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to shop amount round(spend[m], minor(PLN), half-even)

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, end_of(m)) from day_of(m, dom) random at mean - floor)

version v
  cite own
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  spend_mu = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  spend_sd = 100.00 PLN "own"
  spend_dom = 15 "own"
  dom = 5 "own"
  floor = 8 000.00 PLN "own"
  opening[konto] = 10 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "statement"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "statement"

ask s1: bal(savings, 2026-01-31)
=== expect
s1: 1 000.00 PLN
  left out: save, 1 instances, first 2026-01-05
  held: spend_dom = 15 (v), read for 2026-02-01
  held: spend_mu = 1 000.00 PLN (v), read for 2026-02-01
  held: spend_sd = 100.00 PLN (v), read for 2026-02-01
  cut 2026-01-01
